            "money": -180,
            "sanity": -18,
            "battery": -15,
            "locality": 3
          },
          "feedback": {
            "cn": "腿在抖。相册里全是天空与恐惧。",
            "en": "Legs shake. Gallery: sky and fear."
          },
          "next": "done"
        },
        {
          "id": "talk_back",
          "text": {
            "cn": "回头友好说 Hi，反客为主合影。",
            "en": "Turn, say hi, flip into willing photo subject."
